# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root. Today that is only candidate-app
# (docker-compose.app.yml), which needs candidate-app/ and chrome-extension/ and nothing
# else. Allow-list on purpose: a new top-level directory is excluded unless added here,
# so the build context stays small without anyone remembering to ignore it.
# Other services build from their own directory and use that directory's .dockerignore.
*
!candidate-app
!chrome-extension
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
